# Enforce LF line endings for all text files — in the repository and in the
# working tree on every platform. Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` checks
# files out with CRLF on Windows, which Prettier (`endOfLine: lf`) then flags on
# every line, making `yarn lint` red locally even though the committed blobs are
# LF. `text=auto` lets Git auto-detect and leave binary files untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Belt-and-braces: never normalize these binary types.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.p12 binary
*.mobileprovision binary
